  "content": "<h4><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1296776/description_51ca7224-edde-4860-a9e1-3678cfa86cd7.png\" alt=\"logo\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"> &nbsp;所以目前這個整合包有 195 個模組。</h4>\n<h2><strong style=\"display:inline !important\">&nbsp; 我們都有什麼：</strong></h2>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-style:italic\">\n<h3><em>- 新結構&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - 新的生物群落和自然</em></h3>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-style:italic\">\n<h3><em>- 增強維度&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - 裝飾</em></h3>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-style:italic\">\n<h3><em>- 沉浸感&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - 合作功能</em></h3>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-style:italic\">\n<h3><em>- 新武器&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - 遊戲實用工具</em></h3>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-style:italic\">\n<h3><em>- 新增生物&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - 性能模組</em></h3>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-style:italic\">\n<h3><em>- 增加極限模式&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - 太空</em></h3>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 而最重要的一件事是：宇宙中最強武器的：</p>\n<h3>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#bfedd2\">變型金剛</span></strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>整個整合包經歷了很多更改，這絕不是最終版本。</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">未來計劃：</span></p>\n<p><em>為新手準備的任務線</em><br><em>新選單</em><br><em>更多外來進化模組</em></p>\n<p>註意：下載量越多，我們就越有動力。</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">建議：</span></p>\n<p><em>為了舒適和正常幀率，至少分配 8GB RAM。</em><br><em>和朋友一起玩（整合包已為此配置）。</em><br><em>分享此整合包。</em><br><em>最重要的是——玩得開心！</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">作者：</span></p>\n<p><strong><em>FauterLOV1 (我本人)</em></strong></p>\n<p><strong><em>Y_U_S_M_A_N (我的朋友)</em></strong></p>\n<p>還要感謝 ALIEN EVO 模組創作者的付出。</p>\n</div>\n<div>@KonaDolomite</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>",
